  "description": "Single and two storey side to rear extensions; conversion of garage to habitable room; rear patio with steps; external alterations&nbsp;",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed first floor rear extension by reason of its size and siting would result in an overly prominent and overbearing development which results in a detrimental impact to the visual and residential amenities of No. 24 Thistlecroft gardens&amp;nbsp; due to an adverse&amp;nbsp;loss of outlook, sunlight and a heightened sense of enclosure. The proposal is therefore contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3.D(7) of The London Plan (2021), Policy DMC of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
